WEBVTT

00:05.605 --> 00:12.807
Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~

00:13.980 --> 00:20.715
No matter where
you are, I'll find you.

00:22.122 --> 00:29.153
I can only watch you...
I can't even talk to you.

00:29.262 --> 00:33.722
Today is going to end,
and we can't see tomorrow.

00:34.300 --> 00:36.928
But they'll turn into a gentle color.

00:38.571 --> 00:45.033
It whirls down from
the sky... Love will shine.

00:45.512 --> 00:53.544
<i>When I turn around,
I always see your smile.</i>

00:54.854 --> 01:02.260
1 wish a day like that would come.

01:02.495 --> 01:10.334
I want to keep
looking at you up close.

01:11.104 --> 01:17.566
I'm sending these great
feelings that never end...

01:17.777 --> 01:22.737
...straight to you.

01:38.631 --> 01:41.532
Four pieces of clothing...

01:42.268 --> 01:45.635
Towel and toiletries...

01:55.582 --> 01:56.571
Tomari-san.

01:57.584 --> 01:59.552
Will you hear me out?

02:01.254 --> 02:04.382
I don't want to keep
hurting Hazumu like this.

02:04.491 --> 02:05.480
So...

02:08.995 --> 02:12.658
We should keep our
relationship like this for a while.

02:13.466 --> 02:17.266
I'm going to do my best starting
tomorrow at training camp!

02:18.404 --> 02:23.603
Small Storm

02:24.210 --> 02:25.700
Seaside Park?

02:25.979 --> 02:28.846
The one that just opened?

02:29.048 --> 02:32.711
Yep! My mother got me four tickets.

02:33.086 --> 02:37.819
<i>So I was hoping to go there
tomorrow with you, Tomari, and Ayuki.</i>

02:37.924 --> 02:39.323
Sounds great!

02:39.425 --> 02:41.552
And so...

02:42.262 --> 02:44.059
I'm sorry, Asuta!

02:44.364 --> 02:47.299
I have supplementary
class tomorrow anyway!

02:47.800 --> 02:51.167
I know! Let's all go
there after my class ends!

02:51.271 --> 02:52.238
Nope.

02:53.439 --> 02:56.636
Tomorrow's the last day
to get the Sirene figure!

02:56.743 --> 02:59.678
You'd choose a figure
over your best friend?

02:59.779 --> 03:00.746
Yeah.

03:01.981 --> 03:03.182
You're so mean, Hazumu...

03:03.183 --> 03:04.650
You're so mean, Hazumu...
It's just...

03:04.851 --> 03:05.977
Tomari-san!

03:06.653 --> 03:09.053
Oh, good timing!

03:12.158 --> 03:14.388
What? That's not fair!

03:14.928 --> 03:16.691
You really can't go?

03:16.996 --> 03:20.295
What can I say?
I have to go to practice.

03:21.334 --> 03:23.564
You never told me that!

03:23.836 --> 03:25.633
I didn't tell you?

03:27.273 --> 03:29.400
I'll be back in five days.

03:29.509 --> 03:31.909
Hazumu, then tomorrow's plan...

03:32.011 --> 03:35.105
Yeah. We'll have to wait
till Tomari comes back.

03:35.215 --> 03:38.184
Can you explain
this kind of reaction to me?

03:38.284 --> 03:42.482
Don't worry about me. Tomorrow's
the last day to get that figure, right?

03:42.589 --> 03:43.389
But...

03:43.389 --> 03:44.356
But...
It's okay. Go and have fun.

03:44.357 --> 03:46.257
It's okay. Go and have fun.

03:46.392 --> 03:48.792
I can't make it tomorrow either.

03:49.162 --> 03:50.220
Ayuki!

03:50.363 --> 03:53.662
I have to go to
a memorial service tomorrow.

03:54.300 --> 03:55.699
Then tomorrow is...

03:55.802 --> 03:56.536
Yes.

03:56.536 --> 03:59.562
Yes.
Well, we can all go next time.

03:59.672 --> 04:01.902
You two can go tomorrow.

04:02.809 --> 04:04.037
Tomari...

04:08.147 --> 04:09.171
Tomari-san!

04:10.483 --> 04:11.415
Yasuna?

04:12.051 --> 04:13.985
Uh, I...

04:17.323 --> 04:20.315
ll told you not to call me Tomari-san.

04:22.695 --> 04:25.789
Are you sure about this?
About us going together...

04:25.898 --> 04:28.128
Things will stay the same, right?

04:28.234 --> 04:30.134
<i>Yeah, I promise.</i>

04:30.236 --> 04:34.297
Then there shouldn't be
any problems. Just go have fun.

04:34.407 --> 04:35.874
I trust you.

04:36.409 --> 04:37.876
We're friends, right?

04:38.711 --> 04:39.905
Tomari-san...

04:40.013 --> 04:43.039
<i>Like I said before,
stop calling me that.</i>

04:43.449 --> 04:44.183
Okay.

04:44.183 --> 04:46.413
<i>Okay.
Well, I should get going.</i>

04:46.519 --> 04:48.783
Oh, and get me a souvenir.

04:48.888 --> 04:49.786
All right.

04:49.889 --> 04:52.790
<i>Get me something that I might like.</i>

04:56.729 --> 04:58.026
Miss Mari.

04:59.165 --> 05:01.759
Did something happen
between you two?

05:02.302 --> 05:03.200
Yes...

05:03.503 --> 05:04.629
ll see.

05:04.837 --> 05:07.670
And you think you two
can make it work?

05:09.709 --> 05:13.668
I don't know if this was
the best choice for the both of us...

05:15.048 --> 05:18.245
...but I'm glad things
turned out this way.

05:28.728 --> 05:30.059
Shutter chance!

05:30.763 --> 05:33.630
Hazumu playing
with a dolphin, captured!

05:34.267 --> 05:37.430
Hazumu looking at
a sunfish in joy, captured!

05:37.837 --> 05:41.603
Hazumu puckering up while
looking at an octopus, captured.

05:45.011 --> 05:46.706
<i>Can I help you?</i>

05:46.813 --> 05:51.409
You said you'll be in the studio
working all day tomorrow, didn't you?

05:51.517 --> 05:53.109
Yeah, that's right.

05:53.219 --> 05:56.052
I see. Then you
won't be needing this.

05:56.122 --> 05:58.113
That's...

05:58.224 --> 06:00.784
Yeah, I'll give this to our neighbor.

06:00.893 --> 06:05.728
I saved up portions of my
525-yen allowance each day...

06:05.832 --> 06:08.232
...to make my dream come true.

06:08.534 --> 06:10.968
Give it back!

06:18.478 --> 06:20.173
Sister Brother!

06:21.647 --> 06:24.309
<i>I want to go with you too!</i>

06:24.584 --> 06:27.052
I don't want to go back.

06:27.120 --> 06:28.246
Go back?

06:28.354 --> 06:29.753
Well, you see...

06:29.889 --> 06:32.153
You came out of nowhere!

06:33.192 --> 06:38.289
We got most of the data we needed, so
we're heading back to the ship for now.

06:38.398 --> 06:39.296
I see.

06:39.399 --> 06:42.300
Sister Brother, I don't want to leave.

06:42.435 --> 06:46.838
Leave? You'll be back when you're
done taking care of things, right?

06:47.407 --> 06:49.307
If the results are better...

06:49.609 --> 06:51.804
What's that?

06:51.911 --> 06:55.938
It's nothing. We'll probably
be back in two to three days.

06:56.048 --> 06:57.174
Puu...

06:57.617 --> 07:03.647
<i>I wanted to go with you to see
the giant squid face the sperm whale...</i>

07:03.956 --> 07:06.618
I don't think you can see that...

07:07.059 --> 07:08.390
Jun Puu, let's go.

07:08.461 --> 07:10.224
Puu, puu!

07:12.732 --> 07:14.859
Kashima High School Track Team

07:14.967 --> 07:17.561
How was your date the other day?

07:17.937 --> 07:20.167
Tell us what happened in detail!

07:20.273 --> 07:22.741
We only went to see a movie.

07:23.543 --> 07:25.841
Just the two of them...

07:26.913 --> 07:30.576
You must've done
something after that, right?

07:30.850 --> 07:32.579
Tell us the truth!

07:32.685 --> 07:36.553
Well, we did kiss before we parted...

07:38.124 --> 07:39.887
So you did do it!

07:39.992 --> 07:41.323
How was it?

07:41.427 --> 07:44.692
"How"? We just
pressed our lips together.

07:45.398 --> 07:47.366
What does that mean?

07:57.343 --> 07:59.140
<i>What am I thinking?</i>

07:59.245 --> 08:01.236
What's wrong, Tomari?

08:02.782 --> 08:05.410
What do you want? You scared me!

08:05.952 --> 08:09.353
Huh? That's weird.
Your face is all red.

08:10.857 --> 08:13.121
Were you listening to us...

08:13.226 --> 08:15.922
...and remembering
when you kissed someone?

08:16.028 --> 08:17.996
What are you saying?

08:18.097 --> 08:19.894
Who was the other party?

08:19.966 --> 08:22.059
It has to be Osaragi.

08:22.235 --> 08:26.069
What are you, stupid?
We're just childhood friends!

08:26.172 --> 08:28.766
There it is!
The "childhood friend" excuse!

08:28.875 --> 08:30.399
It was a pact!

08:30.510 --> 08:33.843
But Osaragi is already a girl, right?

08:34.013 --> 08:38.848
Yeah. Even if they love each other,
they can never be lovers again.

08:38.951 --> 08:41.249
Why you...

08:42.522 --> 08:44.513
That's enough!

08:44.724 --> 08:46.419
We were just joking!

08:58.437 --> 08:59.904
Yasuna!

09:00.573 --> 09:02.734
Sorry, did you wait long?

09:02.842 --> 09:03.809
No.

09:03.976 --> 09:06.103
But if we don't hurry...

09:06.812 --> 09:09.440
The Sirene figures are almost gone!

09:09.715 --> 09:11.046
Please hurry!

09:11.417 --> 09:12.782
Oh no!

09:12.885 --> 09:14.512
Hurry, Yasuna!

09:16.355 --> 09:17.447
Yay!

09:17.957 --> 09:19.720
Are you happy now?

09:19.825 --> 09:20.723
Yeah!

09:21.193 --> 09:23.161
Should we go now?

09:27.600 --> 09:28.567
Yes!

09:33.839 --> 09:35.033
Wow!

09:35.274 --> 09:36.866
That's a tuna...

09:37.376 --> 09:38.638
It's amazing.

09:38.744 --> 09:41.304
Yeah. It looks delicious...

09:43.549 --> 09:45.517
<i>Did I say something strange?</i>

09:46.285 --> 09:47.946
I'll get you, whale!

09:48.054 --> 09:49.351
Come on, squid.

09:49.422 --> 09:51.754
Intense Battle!
Giant Squid vs. Sperm Whale Show

09:54.427 --> 09:56.292
We're really seeing this...

10:02.501 --> 10:04.526
There's nothing here?

10:12.812 --> 10:14.006
Pretty...

10:14.580 --> 10:15.945
Yeah...

10:16.349 --> 10:17.750
Isn't it romantic?

10:17.750 --> 10:18.876
Isn't it romantic?
Yeah.

10:19.986 --> 10:21.112
Silly...

10:31.764 --> 10:34.824
I wanted Tomari and
Ayuki to see this too.

10:36.402 --> 10:38.393
Things will stay the same, right?

10:38.504 --> 10:40.597
<i>Yeah, I promise.</i>

10:44.777 --> 10:46.802
Is something wrong, Yasuna?

10:47.179 --> 10:48.146
No.

10:48.681 --> 10:51.149
Let's come here
again with everyone.

10:51.250 --> 10:52.217
Yeah!

10:52.418 --> 10:53.817
Souvenir Shop

10:54.754 --> 10:57.086
Well, Hazumu, did you decide yet?

10:57.189 --> 10:58.656
Yeah, almost.

10:58.758 --> 11:02.751
That's for my parents.
This one's for Ayuki.

11:02.928 --> 11:04.395
What about Soro's?

11:04.463 --> 11:06.397
This is for Asuta.

11:06.699 --> 11:08.064
A back scratcher?

11:08.167 --> 11:10.260
But not an ordinary one.

11:10.469 --> 11:13.961
Look. It says
"Seaside Park" on the end.

11:14.273 --> 11:15.672
I see...

11:16.275 --> 11:18.675
And what are you
getting Tomari-san?

11:18.778 --> 11:21.611
<i>Well, I don't know what to get her.</i>

11:21.714 --> 11:24.979
Tomari doesn't like
cute and pretty things.

11:25.084 --> 11:28.645
She likes odd things
or things that are surprising.

11:28.754 --> 11:30.312
Surprising...

11:33.793 --> 11:35.021
Surprising!
Giant Whale Shark Cookie

11:35.361 --> 11:39.127
Tomari will definitely be surprised
by that! It'll make her happy!

11:39.298 --> 11:41.892
Do you want to deliver that to her?

11:42.001 --> 11:43.969
At the training camp?

11:44.070 --> 11:45.037
Yes.

11:46.539 --> 11:49.838
Tomari will be really
surprised then. Should we go?

11:49.942 --> 11:50.966
Yes.

11:51.077 --> 11:54.740
I wonder if she'll be happy
with this... Tomari-san.

12:06.792 --> 12:10.125
Kurusu of Kashima High,
you have a phone call.

12:10.229 --> 12:11.423
Coming!

12:12.198 --> 12:13.256
Thank you.

12:13.365 --> 12:14.332
Hello?

12:15.234 --> 12:16.792
Oh, hi, Hazumu.

12:16.902 --> 12:18.802
How'd you get this number?

12:19.138 --> 12:21.971
What? You're at the station here?

12:22.141 --> 12:27.135
<i>Yeah, I was planning to go straight to
your training camp to surprise you...</i>

12:27.246 --> 12:32.206
...but the station employee said
people new to the area might get lost.

12:32.718 --> 12:36.176
I'm waiting here with Yasuna.
Could you come get us?

12:36.455 --> 12:39.652
I'm not here to have fun, you know.

12:40.426 --> 12:43.691
Well, practice is over,
so I'll be there soon.

12:43.796 --> 12:45.354
Sorry, Tomari.

12:45.464 --> 12:47.864
No problem. I'll see you soon.

12:47.967 --> 12:48.934
Okay!

12:49.702 --> 12:51.397
Thank you very much.

12:51.504 --> 12:52.801
No problem.

12:55.307 --> 12:57.468
She said she'll be here soon!

12:57.943 --> 13:00.411
I'm going to call my parents!

13:00.513 --> 13:01.480
Okay!

13:04.517 --> 13:09.147
I'll be home a little later
than usual, but don't worry about me.

13:09.255 --> 13:10.483
Excuse me!

13:11.290 --> 13:14.487
An out-of-service train
will pass by soon.

13:14.593 --> 13:17.494
Please be careful
when crossing the tracks.

13:17.730 --> 13:18.924
All right.

13:22.968 --> 13:24.094
Miss?

13:24.937 --> 13:27.804
What is it? Is something wrong?

13:28.040 --> 13:29.371
No...

13:29.475 --> 13:33.002
If you're not feeling well,
you can rest in the waiting room.

13:33.112 --> 13:35.376
No, I'm okay...

13:36.949 --> 13:38.211
Hazumu...

13:38.884 --> 13:39.816
Miss?

13:40.886 --> 13:43.116
You don't look so good.

13:43.222 --> 13:45.747
Maybe you should
just rest over there...

13:48.260 --> 13:50.694
Miss, what's wrong? Miss?

13:51.797 --> 13:52.855
No!

13:53.833 --> 13:54.822
Yasuna?

13:55.434 --> 13:58.335
Sorry, Mother, I'll have
to call you back later!

13:58.437 --> 13:59.563
Yasuna!

14:00.139 --> 14:01.936
Don't touch her!

14:02.408 --> 14:03.397
Yasuna!

14:04.677 --> 14:06.668
Are you okay, Yasuna?

14:07.079 --> 14:10.139
I just called out to her
since I was concerned...

14:10.249 --> 14:14.447
I'm sorry. She's just not
used to talking to strangers.

14:15.020 --> 14:18.683
She'll be fine if I'm with her.
You don't have to worry.

14:18.791 --> 14:20.782
Come sit down, Yasuna.

14:22.428 --> 14:24.123
Is she really okay?

14:24.230 --> 14:26.391
Yes, sorry for the trouble.

14:26.866 --> 14:29.664
She never meant any ill will.

14:29.768 --> 14:33.636
It's okay. And a train
will be passing by shortly...

14:33.739 --> 14:35.639
...so don't cross till it does.

14:35.741 --> 14:36.901
All right.

14:37.009 --> 14:38.476
On that note...

14:41.080 --> 14:43.776
I'm sorry, Hazumu. I...

14:44.283 --> 14:48.276
I'm sorry too. For not
noticing the situation sooner...

14:48.387 --> 14:50.787
Just try to relax for now.

14:50.890 --> 14:51.857
Okay.

14:54.393 --> 14:57.385
They're not here.
Could they be waiting inside?

15:02.668 --> 15:03.600
Hey!

15:03.736 --> 15:04.896
Hazumu...

15:15.180 --> 15:18.149
<i>Thank you, Hazumu. I feel fine now.</i>

15:18.250 --> 15:19.808
You're calmer now?

15:19.919 --> 15:20.908
Yes.

15:26.659 --> 15:27.626
Why?

15:28.894 --> 15:31.795
I don't want to keep
hurting Hazumu like this.

15:32.097 --> 15:33.223
So...

15:33.699 --> 15:37.135
We should keep our
relationship like this for a while.

15:37.670 --> 15:39.604
<i>Yeah, I promise.</i>

15:41.807 --> 15:42.933
Yasuna...

15:43.842 --> 15:46.072
What's taking Tomari?

15:49.949 --> 15:50.973
Hey!

15:52.518 --> 15:54.145
I'm here, Hazumu!

15:54.253 --> 15:55.185
Tomari!

15:55.754 --> 15:57.949
We were waiting for you, Tomari!

15:58.924 --> 16:01.859
Here's your souvenir! Isn't it great?

16:03.629 --> 16:04.618
What?

16:05.030 --> 16:06.964
The trains aren't running?

16:07.266 --> 16:10.201
Yeah, there's no train
back to the city now.

16:10.302 --> 16:11.394
No way...

16:11.503 --> 16:15.173
You should've checked
the train schedules in the first place.

16:15.174 --> 16:17.540
And you came here for this?

16:17.843 --> 16:19.606
Bon appetit!

16:20.446 --> 16:22.971
That's mine, so don't eat it all.

16:23.148 --> 16:25.548
But what should we do?

16:25.851 --> 16:29.480
Don't worry about it.
I already told the teacher.

16:29.955 --> 16:33.083
You can stay here
in this room for tonight.

16:33.926 --> 16:35.359
Thanks, Tomari!

16:35.661 --> 16:39.028
I'm sorry. This is all my fault...

16:39.264 --> 16:42.597
Yasuna just wanted
to make you happy.

16:42.768 --> 16:45.760
We didn't think
we'd have to stay overnight...

16:45.871 --> 16:48.339
So please don't be mad, Tomari.

16:48.841 --> 16:50.832
I'm not mad at all.

16:51.043 --> 16:53.034
I'm glad you came here.

16:54.480 --> 16:55.378
Really?

16:55.748 --> 16:57.147
Yeah. Really.

16:58.350 --> 17:00.079
Aren't you glad we came?

17:00.185 --> 17:01.311
Yes!

17:13.332 --> 17:14.856
Hey! Hazumu?

17:15.634 --> 17:16.532
Tomari?

17:17.336 --> 17:21.295
<i>You scared me. I couldn't tell
it was you with your hair down.</i>

17:21.407 --> 17:23.068
You were in here?

17:23.442 --> 17:27.879
<i>Yeah, I thought I'd take a bath
after all the track members left.</i>

17:27.980 --> 17:30.380
Look the other way for a second.

17:30.482 --> 17:32.643
Just face the windows!

17:32.751 --> 17:33.945
Okay...

17:41.260 --> 17:44.593
<i>I haven't seen you with
your hair down in a while...</i>

17:44.696 --> 17:46.596
...but you look really girly.

17:46.698 --> 17:49.132
I always act like a guy anyway.

17:49.568 --> 17:52.128
You look cute in pigtails too.

17:52.938 --> 17:56.499
But when you have your
hair down, you look more mature...

17:56.608 --> 17:58.769
...and seem more beautiful.

17:58.877 --> 18:00.845
What are you saying?

18:01.280 --> 18:02.611
You idiot...

18:02.848 --> 18:05.180
You don't have to be embarrassed.

18:05.284 --> 18:07.218
I'm not embarrassed!

18:08.954 --> 18:10.922
So how was it?

18:11.090 --> 18:12.057
What?

18:12.758 --> 18:16.353
Did you have a good time
with Yasuna today?

18:16.628 --> 18:19.028
Yeah, it was really fun!

18:20.799 --> 18:25.600
There was a passage with ostracod
crustaceans. They were so pretty!

18:25.704 --> 18:28.696
<i>Yasuna and I were
fascinated by the scenery!</i>

18:28.807 --> 18:29.933
ll see...

18:30.843 --> 18:33.641
When your training
is over, we should all go.

18:33.745 --> 18:35.042
Yeah.

18:35.347 --> 18:36.871
I can't wait!

18:56.301 --> 18:57.461
Tomari...

19:02.608 --> 19:03.575
Tomari!

19:06.311 --> 19:07.642
Hazumu...

19:08.013 --> 19:11.107
What's wrong, Tomari?
You can't sleep?

19:14.453 --> 19:17.889
Hazumu, can you
keep me company for a bit?

19:26.398 --> 19:27.626
Hazumu?

19:28.033 --> 19:31.196
Going for a walk with
Tomari to the station.

19:31.303 --> 19:34.568
Be back soon.
Don't worry. - Hazumu

19:37.943 --> 19:39.069
Wow!

19:54.560 --> 19:55.925
It's amazing.

19:56.828 --> 20:00.423
I heard this was
the place to get the best view.

20:00.532 --> 20:03.023
Yeah, it's very pretty.

20:05.404 --> 20:08.271
I saw ostracoda
with Yasuna this afternoon...

20:08.373 --> 20:12.332
<i>...and I get to see real fireflies
at night with you, Tomari.</i>

20:12.611 --> 20:15.079
Today was a really good day.

20:16.782 --> 20:18.044
Hazumu...

20:21.119 --> 20:22.211
Tomari?

20:25.724 --> 20:26.713
Well?

20:27.426 --> 20:29.917
<i>Do I look like a girl now?</i>

20:30.028 --> 20:31.290
Tomari...

20:32.130 --> 20:37.158
You became a girl, and with Yasuna,
the three of us became friendly.

20:37.402 --> 20:38.994
Things were fine.

20:39.104 --> 20:42.505
<i>Things would work out if
Yasuna and I became friends...</i>

20:42.608 --> 20:44.576
<i>That's what I thought...</i>

20:45.477 --> 20:50.141
But Yasuna likes you so much
that it's hard to control herself.

20:50.682 --> 20:52.172
Sol...

20:53.585 --> 20:56.145
ll tried so many times to give you up.

20:56.255 --> 20:59.349
Telling myself Yasuna
could make you happy.

20:59.458 --> 21:04.589
She's so well-groomed and lovely...
She's the portrait of a perfect girl.

21:05.464 --> 21:08.456
I'm not like her at all.
Not even close...

21:08.867 --> 21:10.095
Tomari...

21:10.435 --> 21:11.595
But...

21:11.703 --> 21:12.829
still...

21:14.139 --> 21:16.198
...I don't want to lose to her.

21:55.247 --> 21:56.737
Tomari-san...

21:57.049 --> 21:58.016
Why?

22:00.018 --> 22:01.747
You promised...

22:06.625 --> 22:09.651
I trust you. We're friends, right?

22:10.028 --> 22:13.122
I'm glad things turned out this way.

22:16.802 --> 22:18.793
I trusted you...

22:25.077 --> 22:26.044
Liar.

22:35.020 --> 22:40.720
If it's a never-ending road...

22:41.460 --> 22:47.888
...then I'll try to be a little stronger.

22:48.033 --> 22:53.630
You think being kind
only brings pain...

22:54.306 --> 23:00.506
...but that's not true at all.

23:02.581 --> 23:08.542
Looking for the truth...
I was searching for...

23:08.687 --> 23:15.923
...the truth that is
reflected in your heart.

23:17.162 --> 23:22.964
Let's overcome
the sadness and be happy.

23:23.635 --> 23:29.972
<i>Should I put my trust
in a future that I can't see?</i>

23:30.142 --> 23:35.774
Your very first smile...
Please don't make it go away.

23:36.615 --> 23:43.646
<i>I promise you that I will be all right.</i>

23:46.324 --> 23:50.658
Our future is just around the corner.

23:57.002 --> 23:59.869
You lose everything,
and everything disappears.

23:59.971 --> 24:02.201
What's left is despair.

24:03.041 --> 24:05.509
Next time on Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~.

24:05.610 --> 24:07.976
Things That Disappeared
from Yasuna's Eyes.

24:08.046 --> 24:10.207
These feelings... in my heart.
